  <p><u><b><font size="6" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">Our Charter</font></b></u></p>
  <p><font color="#333333" size="5" face="Arial Black">Our guild is designed to not only help 
    members improve and advance their characters but also to Create a Community 
    of true friends who wish to bring their Dreams into Reality, of people who 
    value and strive for honesty, integrity, dignity, respect, compassion and 
    generosity. We hope you enthusiastically and humorously role-play these qualities, 
    creating a place for all of us to creatively express ourselves. To adventure and explore new realms that test 
    our group's unity, strengths and weaknesses, that test our flexibility to 
    meet with craft, guile, intelligence and bravery all challenges that face 
    us.</font></p>
  <p><img src="graphicsbar.gif" width="350" height="32"></p>
  <p><u><b><font size="6" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">Our Motto:</font></b> </u></p>
  <p><b><font size="5" color="#333333" face="Arial Black"> &quot;All 
    that you see or seem, is but a dream within a dream.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font size="5" color="#333333" face="Arial Black"> Turn your dreams into 
    reality."</font></b></p>
  <p>&nbsp;</p>
  <p><img src="graphicsbar.gif" width="350" height="32"></p>
  <p><b><u><font size="6" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">Guild Requirements:</font></u></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">If you
  are:</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">1.) Looking to Join a
  Family Oriented Raiding Guild on the Tunare Server,</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font face="Arial Black"><font size="4" color="#333333">2.) Your MAIN CHARACTER 
    is in the </font><font color="#333333" size="6">40th</font><font size="4" color="#333333"> Season or Year of adventuring,</font></font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">3.)
  Willing to help others and participate in events and raids,&nbsp;</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">4.) Not looking to be
  power-leveled,</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black"> 5.) Comfortable with optional
  role-playing,</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">6.) Dedicated to our Virtues 
    and Ready to defend them with your life....</font></b></p>
  <p align="center"><b><font color="#333333" size="4" face="Arial Black">We would be proud to accept you as 
    a member of our guild!&nbsp;</font><font face="Sylfaen" color="#333333" size="4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></b></p>
  <p align="center"><img src="graphicsbar.gif" width="350" height="32"></p>
  <p><b> <u><font color="#333333" size="6" face="Arial Black">To
  Join Us You Must:</font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><font size="5" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">First: Read our 'Rules of Conduct 
    For Members'&nbsp;</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font size="5" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">Second: Fill out our Join Dreamweaver
  application form&nbsp;</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font size="5" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">Third: Find 3
  Dreamweaver Members to group
  with so you can get a feel for our family,&nbsp;</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font size="5" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">Last: Contact an Officer in Game who
  will Interview you and speak to the 3 members you grouped with.&nbsp;</font></b></p>
</div>


<p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="3">To contact our guild, all prospective
members are welcome to visit our <a href="http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdreamweaversguild92445friends">Message
Board Forum about Joining our Family</a>!</font></b></p>


<p align="center"><img src="graphicsbar.gif" width="350" height="32"></p>
  <p align="center"><b><u><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="6">Our
  VIRTUES are the Code we Play By:</font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"> <u>Strength:</u> Be strong to protect 
    yourself and serve your family.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"><u>Courtesy:</u> Be kind and respectful 
    to others. Do not use profane language to curse other members.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"> <u>Honor:</u> Be honorable in your 
    dealings with others and always keep your word.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"> <u>Justice:</u> Be fair in all your 
    dealings and try to see other's point of view.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"> <u>Faith:</u> Believe in your family 
    and yourself.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"><u>Humility:</u> Be humble and thankful 
    for a family who loves you and all the gifts the gods send you.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"><u>Prudence:</u> Discipline yourself 
    to think before you leap & use good judgment in your actions.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"><u>Temperance:</u> Too much of a good 
    thing can lead to a sickness of the soul. Don't over indulge.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"> <u>Charity:</u> Share your wealth with 
    your family if you can, so they can share their wealth with you.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"> <u>Hope:</u> Always keep your dreams 
    alive. With hope comes new beginnings.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font color="#333333" face="Arial Black" size="4"> <u>Forgiveness:</u> Everyone makes 
    mistakes! We offer a second chance for a new beginning.</font></b></p>
